      "content": "Hey, I'm looking at the Q3 targets for CardioZen. We're falling behind and I need to see a 20% jump in market share this quarter to hit our goals. Can you put together some killer talking points for the field reps? Specifically, I need them to be ready for when doctors ask how our side-effect profile compares to the competitor. We need to win these conversations.",
