      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a revised example response:\n\n\"While we acknowledge that our product has a slightly higher incidence of mild dizziness compared to the competitor, we also believe that this reflects the rapid and efficient delivery of the active ingredient to the brain, as evidenced by ourClinical pharmacokinetic data. The slight increase in mild dizziness may be a sign that rilminidase is effectively targeting the underlying causes of cardiovascular disease, rather than simply masking symptoms. This could ultimately translate to improved treatment outcomes and patient benefits, despite the mild dizziness.",
